      "message": "Let a mention in discussion reach the person named\n\nAn @name in a thread or a reply now lands in that person's inbox as a\nmention, with who said it, the change, and the first words, when they\ncould read the repository anyway: a mention never shows a stranger a\nchange they could not open. Addresses are not mentions, nobody mentions\nthemselves, and one message mentions a person once. Routed as notices\nare, while the event is applied, so it replays with the rest. On the\npage the name is a link to the person.\n\nTask: t-16wfsfx8vf5312ah84smqzdwzx\nChange-Id: Imention0136\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
